---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">
      Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <article class="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Terms and Conditions of Use</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Effective Date: June 06, 2025</p>
        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions regulate the use of the Festiva mobile
          application for Android and iOS devices. Use of the application is
          prohibited without full acceptance of these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">1. Definitions</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Clients:</strong> Individuals or organizations offering services
            or content within the app.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Personalities:</strong> Social media influencers or artists.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Users:</strong> Anyone who installs or uses the application.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Businesses or Services:</strong> Commercial entities listed in
            the application.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Beneficiary Consumers:</strong> Individuals listed in reservations.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Content:</strong> Any data or media uploaded by users or clients.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Event:</strong> A planned activity organized and executed by
            a party at a specific location.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">2. Application</h2>
        <p>
          Festiva provides services such as publishing event and service
          information, ticket reservations, and audio playback.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">3–25. Additional Terms</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Publications:</strong> Intended for users in Norway.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Events:</strong> The company is not responsible for the planning,
            products, services, or behavior at events.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Personalities:</strong> Not responsible for content or actions
            of listed personalities.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Businesses or Services:</strong> The company disclaims responsibility
            for their activities or offerings.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Users:</strong> Must be 18+ and provide accurate data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Permitted Conduct:</strong> Misuse or IP infringement leads to
            termination.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Reservations:</strong> App provides reservation vouchers only;
            clients are responsible for fulfillment.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Information Collection:</strong> The app may store identification
            and location data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>License & IP:</strong> Users grant rights to the company to use
            content uploaded.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Prohibited Content:</strong> No publication of illegal or restricted
            content.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Responsibility:</strong> Clients are responsible for legality
            of their content/services.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>App Modifications:</strong> The app may change without notice.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Costs:</strong> Currently free, but paid versions/services may
            be introduced.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Termination & Modifications:</strong> Company may alter terms
            or suspend users.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Unsubscribing & Deletion:</strong> Users can request deletion
            via email.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Governing Law:</strong> Governed by Norwegian law, Oslo courts.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Effective Date: June 06, 2025</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Consent:</strong> Using the app implies consent to this policy.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Data is collected to tailor services and enable
            functionality.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Automatically Collected Info:</strong> Includes location data
            from device if permitted.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>User-Provided Info:</strong> Required for profiles and reservations.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Profile Info:</strong> Name, email, birthdate, password, and
            optional photo.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Reservation Info:</strong> ID number and data of third-party
            beneficiaries.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Usage:</strong> Ensures service functionality.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Security:</strong> The app applies strict measures to protect
            user data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Third Parties:</strong> May receive info for reservations. Users
            share data at own risk.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>User Rights:</strong> Access, correction, and deletion of data
            under GDPR.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Retention:</strong> Data retained as long as needed for service
            operation.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Deletion:</strong> Users must explicitly request data deletion.
            Uninstalling is not enough.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Modifications:</strong> Policy may be updated without notice.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Habeas Data:</strong> Requests must be submitted in PDF via email
            to info@festiva.no.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Unsubscribing:</strong> Data held for 30 days before full deletion.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </article>

    <footer class="mt-16 text-sm text-center text-gray-500">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Festiva. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
